{"id":69256,"date":"2026-08-06T09:48:06","date_gmt":"2026-08-06T08:48:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69256"},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:14:02","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:14:02","slug":"duatlo-de-barcelos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/duatlo-de-barcelos\/","title":{"rendered":"Duatlo de Barcelos 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Duatlo de Barcelos 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Duatlo de Barcelos 2027<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, dia <strong>24 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partida e chegada na <strong>Rua de Oliven\u00e7a<\/strong>, em <strong>Barcelos<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>), e in\u00edcio oficial marcado para as <strong>10:00<\/strong>. Integrado no <strong>Desafio Norte de Triatlo<\/strong> e limitado a 500 participantes, este Duatlo Sprint permite competir a solo ou em estafetas (duplas masculinas, femininas e mistas).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O desafio na emblem\u00e1tica Cidade do Galo e Cidade Criativa da UNESCO em Artesanato divide-se em tr\u00eas segmentos: um 1\u00ba segmento de <strong>5 km de corrida<\/strong> (1 volta pela Rua de Oliven\u00e7a, Circular de Barcelos e Avenida Jo\u00e3o Duarte), seguido de <strong>20 km de ciclismo de estrada<\/strong> (4 voltas de 5 km na Rua Pedro \u00c1lvares Cabral e Circular de Barcelos, com <em>drafting<\/em> permitido) e um 3\u00ba segmento final de <strong>2,5 km de corrida<\/strong> at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta na Rua de Oliven\u00e7a. Podes calcular os teus ritmos de corrida na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e explorar mais provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-5km\/\">Corridas 5 km<\/a> ou o calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-braga\/\">corridas em Braga<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Fundista \u2013 Ag\u00eancia de Marketing Desportivo<\/strong> com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Barcelos, o evento disp\u00f5e de parque de transi\u00e7\u00e3o na Rua Pedro \u00c1lvares Cabral, cronometragem por chip, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos nos segmentos de atletismo e final l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido na meta, premiando os tr\u00eas primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (incluindo Paratletas e estafetas) e as tr\u00eas melhores equipas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Rua de Oliven\u00e7a (Parque de Transi\u00e7\u00e3o na Rua Pedro \u00c1lvares Cabral), Barcelos, Braga<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Duatlo Sprint: 5 km Corrida + 20 km Ciclismo + 2,5 km Corrida (Solo e Duplas)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Fundista \u2013 Ag\u00eancia de Marketing Desportivo<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2 horas<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/storage\/files\/eventos\/f057\/60c2\/d4d6\/481b\/b3b9\/2e67\/68b4\/33f3.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Duatlo Sprint<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Duatlo Sprint \u2013 Solo<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 30.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (11\/01 a 17\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Duatlo Estafetas<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Duatlo Sprint \u2013 Duplas (Estafetas)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (Dupla):<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/01\/2027 (12.50 \u20ac\/atleta))<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (Dupla):<\/strong> 35.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (11\/01 a 17\/01\/2027 (17.50 \u20ac\/atleta))<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hora de partida e programa do Duatlo de Barcelos 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Duatlo de Barcelos 2027 realiza-se no domingo, dia 24 de janeiro de 2027, na Rua de Oliven\u00e7a, em Barcelos. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:30 e fecha \u00e0s 09:30; o parque de transi\u00e7\u00e3o (na Rua Pedro \u00c1lvares Cabral) abre \u00e0s 08:00 e encerra \u00e0s 09:40; a partida oficial (Solo e Duplas) d\u00e1-se \u00e0s 10:00 e a entrega de pr\u00e9mios est\u00e1 prevista para as 12:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os 3 segmentos do Duatlo Sprint de Barcelos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova disputa-se na dist\u00e2ncia Sprint (tempo limite de 2 horas): 1\u00ba segmento de 5 km de corrida (1 volta), 2\u00ba segmento de 20 km de ciclismo de estrada (4 voltas de 5 km na Circular de Barcelos e Rua Pedro \u00c1lvares Cabral, com drafting permitido) e 3\u00ba segmento de 2,5 km de corrida at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta na Rua de Oliven\u00e7a.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para Solo e Duplas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o limitadas a 500 participantes (idade m\u00ednima de 16 anos) e dividem-se em duas fases: at\u00e9 10 de janeiro de 2027 custam 20,00 \u20ac a Solo e 25,00 \u20ac por Dupla (12,50 \u20ac por atleta); de 11 a 17 de janeiro de 2027 custam 30,00 \u20ac a Solo e 35,00 \u20ac por Dupla (17,50 \u20ac por atleta). Inclui t-shirt, seguro, cronometragem e abastecimentos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que tipos de bicicleta s\u00e3o permitidos no segmento de ciclismo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Apenas s\u00e3o permitidas bicicletas de estrada convencionais e uso obrigat\u00f3rio de capacete r\u00edgido afivelado. N\u00e3o s\u00e3o permitidas bicicletas de contrarrel\u00f3gio (&#8216;cabras&#8217;), bicicletas de BTT nem extensores que ultrapassem as manetes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Duatlo de Barcelos 2027 e como funcionam as estafetas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Fundista \u2013 Ag\u00eancia de Marketing Desportivo com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Barcelos. Nas Duplas (Masculinas, Femininas ou Mistas), 2 atletas dividem livremente os 3 segmentos, efetuando a passagem do testemunho (dorsal) exclusivamente na zona definida no parque de transi\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Duatlo de Barcelos 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-24\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Rua de Oliven\u00e7a (Parque de Transi\u00e7\u00e3o na Rua Pedro \u00c1lvares Cabral)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Barcelos\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Fundista \u2013 Ag\u00eancia de Marketing Desportivo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hora de partida e programa do Duatlo de Barcelos 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Duatlo de Barcelos 2027 realiza-se no domingo, dia 24 de janeiro de 2027, na Rua de Oliven\u00e7a, em Barcelos. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:30 e fecha \u00e0s 09:30; o parque de transi\u00e7\u00e3o (na Rua Pedro \u00c1lvares Cabral) abre \u00e0s 08:00 e encerra \u00e0s 09:40; a partida oficial (Solo e Duplas) d\u00e1-se \u00e0s 10:00 e a entrega de pr\u00e9mios est\u00e1 prevista para as 12:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os 3 segmentos do Duatlo Sprint de Barcelos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova disputa-se na dist\u00e2ncia Sprint (tempo limite de 2 horas): 1\u00ba segmento de 5 km de corrida (1 volta), 2\u00ba segmento de 20 km de ciclismo de estrada (4 voltas de 5 km na Circular de Barcelos e Rua Pedro \u00c1lvares Cabral, com drafting permitido) e 3\u00ba segmento de 2,5 km de corrida at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta na Rua de Oliven\u00e7a.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para Solo e Duplas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o limitadas a 500 participantes (idade m\u00ednima de 16 anos) e dividem-se em duas fases: at\u00e9 10 de janeiro de 2027 custam 20,00 \u20ac a Solo e 25,00 \u20ac por Dupla (12,50 \u20ac por atleta); de 11 a 17 de janeiro de 2027 custam 30,00 \u20ac a Solo e 35,00 \u20ac por Dupla (17,50 \u20ac por atleta). Inclui t-shirt, seguro, cronometragem e abastecimentos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que tipos de bicicleta s\u00e3o permitidos no segmento de ciclismo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Apenas s\u00e3o permitidas bicicletas de estrada convencionais e uso obrigat\u00f3rio de capacete r\u00edgido afivelado. N\u00e3o s\u00e3o permitidas bicicletas de contrarrel\u00f3gio ('cabras'), bicicletas de BTT nem extensores que ultrapassem as manetes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o Duatlo de Barcelos 2027 e como funcionam as estafetas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Fundista \u2013 Ag\u00eancia de Marketing Desportivo com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Barcelos. Nas Duplas (Masculinas, Femininas ou Mistas), 2 atletas dividem livremente os 3 segmentos, efetuando a passagem do testemunho (dorsal) exclusivamente na zona definida no parque de transi\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1